{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The world has ended. Now it\u2019s up to you to make sure what\u2019s left survives.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The Prepper</strong> is a <strong>turn-based survival and management game</strong> where every decision could be the one that saves\u2014or dooms\u2014your bunker.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83e\udde9 Key Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Prepping Phase (Days 1\u20137)</strong> \u2013 Stock up from a limited shop, manage your budget, and prepare for the unknown.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Daily Survival</strong> \u2013 Each day brings new challenges: random events, system failures, morale breakdowns, and apocalyptic weather.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Occupant Management</strong> \u2013 Each survivor has unique skills and careers that affect scavenging, crafting, engineering, and morale.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Scavenging Missions</strong> \u2013 Risk the outside world to find rare items, blueprints, and resources\u2026 or lose everything.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dynamic Event System</strong> \u2013 Hundreds of daily events where <strong>choices matter</strong>, leading to resource changes, item gains/losses, or even death.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Multiple Scenarios</strong> \u2013 AI Uprising, Asteroid Impact, Alien Invasion, and more\u2014each with unique weather, events, and items.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Replayability</strong> \u2013 No two runs are the same thanks to randomized events, weather streaks, and scenario-specific challenges.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Leaderboard</strong> \u2013 Compete to see if your score can beat other players.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><u>Screen Shots</u></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >